    "head_branch": "feature/test-only-fight-pieces-retired",
    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): retire the fight's test-only pieces (spec 39 step 8b5-xxi)\n\nThe tick fights in one crate pass (fight_step), so the pieces only tests\nstill called go: BlowLanding.land, FormationMelee.blows,\nUnitHealth.hurt_landed, FormationStamina.strike, FormationWounds.surrender\nand the fight_choose, fight_land, fight_hurts, stamina_strike and\nwounds_surrenders bindings, with BodyField's fight_synced.\n\nTheir tests move onto the pass or rest on the crate's own: the melee's\ntargets and cooldowns now through FormationMelee.fight; bury reads the\nlast blow's wounds from the store, the landing's write of them being\nfight/tests.rs'; the arms, the hurts, the cleared targets and the\nsurrender (never_surrenders included) are already cargo tests.\nFought.melee stays: the step's cargo tests read it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi4t2Y6aomB2kW5oSkZ",
